---
description: Python implementation requirements
globs: ["**/*.py", "pyproject.toml"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Support every Python version declared in `pyproject.toml`.
- Use explicit types, pathlib, atomic writes, bounded inputs, and deterministic serialization.
- Keep the dependency surface small and justify every runtime dependency.
- Do not commit generated files, caches, build outputs, or local workspaces.
- Add or update tests before considering implementation complete.
